{
  "defaults": {
    "frame_rate": 24,
    "height": 800,
    "length": 49,
    "negative_prompt": "色调艳丽，过曝，静态，细节模糊不清，字幕，风格，作品，画作，画面，静止，整体发灰，最差质量，低质量，JPEG压缩残留，丑陋的，残缺的，多余的手指，画得不好的手部，画得不好的脸部，畸形的，毁容的，形态畸形的肢体，手指融合，静止不动的画面，杂乱的背景，三条腿，背景人很多，倒着走",
    "width": 480
  },
  "description": "Workflow for Wan 2.2 image to video generation",
  "groups": [{
    "id": 1,
    "member_nodes": ["1", "note:1"],
    "title": "CLIP Configuration"
  }, {
    "id": 2,
    "member_nodes": ["3", "4", "note:2"],
    "title": "Diffusion Models"
  }],
  "name": "Wan 2.2",
  "nodes": {
    "1": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load CLIP"
      },
      "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "clip_name": "clip.safetensors",
        "device": "default",
        "type": "wan"
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "ModelSamplingSD3 (Low Noise)"
      },
      "class_type": "ModelSamplingSD3",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["4", 0],
        "shift": 8
      }
    },
    "100": {
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "lora_name": "main_lora.safetensors",
        "model": ["3", 0],
        "strength_model": 0.800000011920929
      }
    },
    "101": {
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "lora_name": "high_lora.safetensors",
        "model": ["100", 0],
        "strength_model": 0.5
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "KSampler (Advanced) - High Noise"
      },
      "class_type": "KSamplerAdvanced",
      "inputs": {
        "add_noise": "enable",
        "cfg": 3.5,
        "end_at_step": 10,
        "latent_image": ["8", 2],
        "model": ["9", 0],
        "negative": ["8", 1],
        "noise_seed": "1234567890123",
        "positive": ["8", 0],
        "return_with_leftover_noise": "enable",
        "sampler_name": "euler",
        "scheduler": "simple",
        "start_at_step": 0,
        "steps": 20
      }
    },
    "12": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "KSampler (Advanced) - Low Noise"
      },
      "class_type": "KSamplerAdvanced",
      "inputs": {
        "add_noise": "disable",
        "cfg": 3.5,
        "end_at_step": 20,
        "latent_image": ["11", 0],
        "model": ["10", 0],
        "negative": ["8", 1],
        "noise_seed": "1234567890123",
        "positive": ["8", 0],
        "return_with_leftover_noise": "disable",
        "sampler_name": "euler",
        "scheduler": "simple",
        "start_at_step": 10,
        "steps": 20
      }
    },
    "13": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "VAE Decode"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEDecode",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["12", 0],
        "vae": ["2", 0]
      }
    },
    "14": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Create Video"
      },
      "class_type": "CreateVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "fps": "24",
        "images": ["13", 0]
      }
    },
    "15": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Save Video"
      },
      "class_type": "SaveVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "codec": "auto",
        "filename_prefix": "video/ComfyChair",
        "format": "auto",
        "video": ["14", 0]
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load VAE"
      },
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "vae.safetensors"
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Diffusion Model (High Noise)"
      },
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "high_unet.safetensors",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      }
    },
    "4": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Diffusion Model (Low Noise)"
      },
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "low_unet.safetensors",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      }
    },
    "5": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Image"
      },
      "class_type": "LoadImage",
      "inputs": {
        "image": "source_upload.png [input]"
      }
    },
    "6": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt)"
      },
      "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
      "inputs": {
        "clip": ["1", 0],
        "text": "A \"red\" fox\nin snow \\ test"
      }
    },
    "7": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Negative Prompt)"
      },
      "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
      "inputs": {
        "clip": ["1", 0],
        "text": "blurry, \"bad\""
      }
    },
    "8": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "WanImageToVideo"
      },
      "class_type": "WanImageToVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "batch_size": 1,
        "height": "480",
        "length": "49",
        "negative": ["7", 0],
        "positive": ["6", 0],
        "start_image": ["5", 0],
        "vae": ["2", 0],
        "width": "832"
      }
    },
    "9": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "ModelSamplingSD3 (High Noise)"
      },
      "class_type": "ModelSamplingSD3",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["101", 0],
        "shift": 8
      }
    }
  },
  "notes": [{
    "content": "### Recommended CLIP Model\n\nUse **UMT5 XXL FP8 e4m3fn** for optimal text understanding with Wan 2.2 video generation.",
    "id": 1,
    "title": "CLIP Model Selection"
  }, {
    "content": "### High/Low Noise UNETs\n\nWan 2.2 requires **two separate UNET models** for the diffusion process:\n\n- **High Noise UNET:** Handles the initial denoising steps\n- **Low Noise UNET:** Refines the final output\n\n---\n\n*Both models must be loaded for proper video generation.*",
    "id": 2,
    "title": "Dual UNET Architecture"
  }]
}
